    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19421" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gĕnĕrātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		genero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an engenderer</i>, <i>generator</i>,
				<i>producer</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nosse autem generatores suos optime poterant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Univ. 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Acragas ... magnanimūm quondam
					generator equorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 704</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Sap. 13, 3</span></i>.</div>
